# Overtime Claim Sheet — read AGENTS.md

This repo is a **mobile PWA** for logging phlebotomy overtime and downloading the **official Synnovis Excel template** (`public/template.xlsx`). **Never recreate the spreadsheet layout.**

**Live:** https://tawfiqahmedabir.github.io/overtime-claim-sheet/

**Repo:** https://github.com/TawfiqAhmedAbir/overtime-claim-sheet (`main` → auto-deploy to Pages)

**Full context:** [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) — status, cell map, architecture, V7 backlog, UX history. **V6 shipped** (Aug 2026).

## Quick rules for agents

1. Excel output must load `public/template.xlsx`, fill mapped cells only, then download/share.
2. After any `src/lib/excel.ts` change: run `npm run test:excel`.
3. After any `src/lib/hours.ts` change: run `npm run test:overtime`.
4. Keep `stripFormulaResults()` before save — prevents ExcelJS writing invalid `NaN` cached values.
5. **Times:** native `<input type="time">` via `TimeField`. **Break:** 3 chips + Other `<select>`. **Overtime:** auto-calculated; override via `<select>` only (no free typing).
6. **Full form on one screen** — no start/finish wizard. Do not reintroduce steppers, scroll wheels, or drum pickers without explicit user request.
7. Column D = auto-calculated overtime text; formula: weekday `(finish − start − break) − normalShift`; weekend/BH = full on-site time.
8. Row for day N: `N + 14`. Month anchor: cell **H7** (UTC noon, 1st of month).
9. Use `ConfirmSheet` for confirms — no `window.confirm` / `window.alert`.
10. User prefers **plan first, wait for "Go"** before implementing non-trivial changes.
11. **Do not git commit** unless the user explicitly asks.
12. New phones get a setup screen (name, job, site, normal shift, start, finish, break). Existing saved data skips it. Home-screen install guidance is **Android only**.
